  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc259007ea40ed5e91227e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我个性悠哉……所以不会发现\r\n自己状态不佳呢。没问题的。\r\n来吧，出发啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4a4b905c5dc9ea23b2e14591e603953516a3f142cd80cf0770a228141bf843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d658bc3d2cb120334df2dea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不佳，\r\n我还是要尽量发挥现在所有的实力～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd6ba6b203abe591aa9c347d31d8336d4f373887f1c5925b56ad6c5b6097e14e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02cda4e8c795204888ea4533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至今以来的等待，\r\n以及努力过的时光……\r\n可不能因为这点小事就白费了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f649c845a78652131cc7f2addc3f20ffcaadc25596d9ce9f52665090bf732825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1bb6d5eba59e51b2c922b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出发啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "faee43848b544be6c1042f85f720d8f624cffefa7c0e1e41df85cf9e672e4728",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d759377d60e05a6e43ad6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲呀～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e264eb5af7b4e0da8c956e870cd0c7a8e3af33790dfb10305e87914ee38e27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a070e5ccc84c2e9240e0c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0700ba8d86c0e54b192ed7f0b740f1a206c9943fe79517f6f1a7bff29f17ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43d93e482b7029d50184536e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e90e925d4e1022f76dcdb00f4e1b8c947ac4a632644c60fbc899a49fb26b025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaeef24cb1f595612d11b57e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b87b4b03ff9bd567bcafb9f2efc067030ee30ac71b8cf8b4b9947b53ce7e9f10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:906391975271648f88bb5deb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也不晓得～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd3fddf5ce9898b5690136efb07fd845fdc3771b2cdd33dd5c1fc35b88618250",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cdf6a48574c3df7bc48fa12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2548fb5f79fc734c38892900db400818e25ed3bb406f4854ca05fc1e5e70330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cb5b0e4135b90d25ed45bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是美丽呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7279bb085b495e87c604b541692188d42cbc0809b46fbd6518e8d0b54a44d0cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8578582767cadfde9aea0609",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是个美妙的回忆呢，训练员～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd1ea0e063a1af14c44eb1b7bf6c850e533059e0f3c5faf74b37e1330551e9f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b036823e46d30b1fd95f1174",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，非常感谢你～",
      "source_fingerprint": "378cd275e17641c092ccaca8d85227e70c2ff45f5b8aa9d7adeb6f9433b8a65d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c75bb1a241eb9bc17877a264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好精进磨练自己吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ad0ae2897b863d83394093b7476c68ec3bec81b3ceddbcde48b8c81aee25051",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7570694a589a08effedc2322",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出发了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a79537b0188ea0cc52d3350624912686b252360f7834155cce5bbee89d61bfce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e07e17746be8cb2a75b8881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位～都准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07994cfde89746b9886c0ba91eea6461a95aa88df65de4b79e4117f4878533f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2793373b5f355111f64e1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，非常感谢你～",
      "source_fingerprint": "378cd275e17641c092ccaca8d85227e70c2ff45f5b8aa9d7adeb6f9433b8a65d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e339ecd80c7690f3f3529e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了在那里绽放光芒……\r\n我会好好加油的，\r\n训练员～",
      "source_fingerprint": "be45757c0bbd1ae0a4d3c491fddae202486fabfa7107eb571009cde117ed6edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55468eb20ca58a9fec6502ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在非常冷静。\r\n但内心深处却非常炙热～我听得到\r\n有个声音对我说「一定要赢」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ff9851ba6d407866de1644cae52047f226a952810d1fd9f75690bcdbd3d17c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fd599cdd52e7f2f781a87fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，非常感谢你～",
      "source_fingerprint": "378cd275e17641c092ccaca8d85227e70c2ff45f5b8aa9d7adeb6f9433b8a65d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae3e3592161a4c223e69abf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きますわよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4ba666c27494080e9cfa50d91c4d059af43bf36f48afac751ef5e715b66669",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1822e7f4aaeac6967ff6fb07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一点。再一点就能闪耀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d32b8a34d9dcef2c9f3b7729833e87b999dfa0dc3addab1aea3f6547f27bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4515357d5acf675d19cfcd19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我会更～加努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4eb87457110d4931d4bffa4803047cda736f3aa35b6113a04981063536da773",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d660b82533f5ad5fca9d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的，慢慢前进吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f61209f5cda91697bfda59130f9578c7269423b3c7cd3aff0641cb695c58fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2efbd6d790694326b0e313b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是太过悠哉了一点呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d2a15a6a8146c062da841bed30bbc1ad1dca1d8bae6d5c89eda3a8d7dd71cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93bd7fab334dd4a8e1b77d1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……哇～♪\r\n我顺利绽放光芒了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "571d0ba950189e2c44a53841758cbca53b6f32fc8b5b9df181ae2a9241d6b324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bacbeb3ff0e6d04391b1693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等待与努力……终于夺下的胜利～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac92be0306a3426cdabddfdf71d143d23d1045f8891300ef622c6dccf7c2365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de486a9624f64cfb1e67f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "聖なる栄光は、\r\nあなたさまに贈ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd64bb8307e3ad3e46d2a0688202331034a145aea278317f20c772255a7a075",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5735c3a915c981f9aea9ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "待って、重ねて…掴んだ勝利ですわ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b505ece698066d3960e717e0f42eb7dc8988afa19194e0cfea3666a5dc8c97b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37428a1addb3d703be8f0c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要出发啰～",
      "source_fingerprint": "faee43848b544be6c1042f85f720d8f624cffefa7c0e1e41df85cf9e672e4728",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab575efe6b0025899cb8a205",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，是时候盛大绽放了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74a28d395ccb4b8881b0bc00663f96761c903395b26658cf6cdde3784d241a45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c53bcb2c6b2093882c80c43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之前订购的\r\n加压训练服送到了～♪\r\n穿去参加队伍练习吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c094a22c74455d5e03d6d74c0190998e14560a441199b6982b0c985f958f9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db08b8cb1b8175d3e6b3f4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着目的地，我要从容、悠闲地\r\n走过去～。因为这，就是属于我的\r\n“最快”了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "310020b6b5e2e1a3ac72ec88dbbfee35b8531d7531e6853bf6ced0cd7ec98196",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af4868f381e347bd96d25ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わたくしのサンタ衣装とお揃いの\r\nマキちゃんの服も作りましたの～。\r\n会場で一緒に写真を撮らなくては♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "62654bac2c3b92fc38aacc518997957aa53c7caa5e25eac59a1c7cd56d7cb98b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e961e37095da2c1c1e222e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……啊，时机来临了呢。\r\n觉醒吧……属于我的春天啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "16883c7a0d190992259edf7355d7cca1ed5638489f68db81b1a2521ddecb9253",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a858b2f0fc3dbf6846aab06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要坚持努力、持续奔跑，一定\r\n有办法抓住荣耀……！总有一天\r\n我要将荣耀献给姐姐～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2b6a6253b4892f3a99c22f4521877e9489d36786ee53f1d484c92ec41ec66fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb6482e49452cc6428a81135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些是活动任务～\r\n用自己的步调\r\n前进吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4358cf66f38aa2c75dc016b6b3c11e830bd7b0f0ed9d3fe654275df566aa381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df8511906e064307b5eadea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有忘记领取的东西呢？\r\n别慌张，\r\n慢慢检查～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab3b04ca6f709c9786a8572c7b04eb815896d36c2b58ccb5d8509c28402989a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0051c2d5dca2f011160b630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスマスの魔法をどうぞ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21da06cb514748003291c5fc068d57ae2fa4607ca1ecafc355e2c3838452d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f17663bc8026875cbd170ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そこは輝くおとぎの国　大切な夢を集めた宝箱\r\n魔法をかけます　メリークリスマス♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ef42c2dc6b2a2980a1db92af38f3c678efba289cbb327624f6f4f84cf4c55a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c526a1430d715110849578",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔からのメジロ家ファンの皆さまも\r\n個性的でしてよ～。“お姉さま担”\r\nの方とは、とてもお話が弾みますの",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8d0136698842fb34079603a2b74be3500c6eee41cd1bd99393a7c47496098ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435864793c87741d5adbec0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご恩返しのつもりだったのですが…\r\nお姉さまと、ファンの皆さまの笑顔\r\n逆に、いただいてしまいましたわね",
      "source_fingerprint": "625c465b0cde145fc3d47d78b4c7dbc813998be86501cccdbc1231e9c2c09b17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8600697a327319ec71e985b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "潘多拉小姐送给我的照片，\r\n我有用相框装饰起来哦。唔呼呼，\r\n每次看到都能获得满满的活力呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "864f3fd927d2f0e9473027cfc046cfa85d31ce0ea282b3448e7307f53baef81f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "400138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ed7016b0a17bbe4b72a218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18eabea1cbd46042a2f43364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7a21842da2da756d2638312d58df5cabcef4c00e2156cd5fcf55995c8af404",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
